# Build context of apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (both built from the repo root).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
.git
.github
.superpowers
docs
**/.DS_Store
# Tests never reach an image (apps/api: modules/*/tests, kernel/tests, test/; web: e2e and the *.test.ts beside the source).
**/tests
apps/api/test
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
